{
  "//": [
    "Terrain, coilwood and the ruins.",
    "",
    "Ruin husks are readable broken versions of live machines -- recognition is",
    "the storytelling, so each one has to be identifiable as the thing it used to",
    "be. Their GLOW children stay emissive-black, because a dead socket reads as",
    "an eye. A bone-coloured salvage tag recurs across the whole set, so one prior",
    "survivor threads the entire environment together; the Arc Forge shell holds",
    "the set's single live ember.",
    "",
    "Ported from modelgen/gen_terrain.py and gen_beacon.py. Blender was Z-up and",
    "this is Y-up."
  ],

